### Crear cliente Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Carlos",
    "surname": "Director",
    "email": "admin@club.com",
    "doc": "1111111",
    "password": "admin123",
    "birth_date": "1980-01-01",
    "type_user": "Admin"
}

### Crear cliente Socio
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lionel",
    "surname": "Messi",
    "email": "socio@club.com",
    "doc": "2222222",
    "password": "socio123",
    "birth_date": "1987-06-24",
    "type_user": "Socio"
}



### Obtener todos los clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients

### Obtener un cliente
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/2

### Obtener un cliente (con error)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/clients/1234

### Crear un nuevo cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Cristiano",
    "surname": "Ronaldo",
    "email": "cr7@mail.com",
    "doc": "1234567",
    "password": "*ctr3*",
    "birth_date": "2026-07-03",
    "type_user": "Socio",
    "sports": [3]
}

### Crear otro cliente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Lionel",
    "surname": "Messi",
    "email": "Messi@mail.com",
    "doc": "doc",
    "password": "*ctr*",
    "birth_date": "2026-07-03",
    "type_user": "Socio",
    "sports": [3]
}



### Modificar a un cliente (PUT -> Recurso completo, idempotente)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/clients/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "sports": [1,3]
}


### Eliminar un cliente
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/clients/36b8f84d-df4e-4d49-b662-bcde71a8764f